69
00:13:35.291 --> 00:13:38.332
<i>You've reached Susan LeMarque.
Please leave a message.</i>

70
00:13:40.316 --> 00:13:42.178
Hey, Mom.

71
00:13:44.887 --> 00:13:46.810
I'm out boarding.

72
00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:49.175
I just had to get away for a few days.

73
