162
00:38:24.999 --> 00:38:26.817
<i>Hey, Mom.</i>

163
00:38:27.870 --> 00:38:29.925
<i>I'm out boarding.</i>

164
00:38:30.005 --> 00:38:32.425
<i>I just had to get away for a few days.</i>

165
00:38:35.743 --> 00:38:38.396
<i>Look, I never wanted
to bring you into this, so...</i>

166
00:38:39.721 --> 00:38:41.577
